This is how strtok returns tokens too.<p>Incidentally I only found this after trying:<p><pre><code>    char tmp[] = "cat,mat,sat";
    char *t;

    t = strtok(tmp,",");
    while(t != NULL){
      printf("%s
",t);
      t = strtok(NULL,",");
    }
</code></pre>
And getting a segfault, as 'tmp' is not writeable memory.
